@startuml Delivery Order Management - Sequence Diagram

skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceActorFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceBoxFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontName Times New Roman

title Sequence Diagram - Mengelola Delivery Order (Supplier)

actor "Supplier" as Supplier
participant "Filament UI" as UI
participant "Shipment\nResource" as Resource
participant "Shipment\nModel" as Shipment
participant "Database" as DB
participant "Notification" as Notif

== Lihat Purchase Order ==
Supplier -> UI: Akses menu Purchase Order
activate UI

note right of UI
    Filter otomatis:
    Hanya tampilkan PO supplier sendiri
end note

UI -> Resource: Request PO list
activate Resource
Resource -> DB: Query PO by supplier_id
activate DB
DB --> Resource: PO data
deactivate DB
Resource --> UI: Filtered PO list
deactivate Resource
UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan daftar PO supplier
deactivate UI

== Buat DO ==
Supplier -> UI: Pilih Purchase Order\nKlik "Buat DO"
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Show DO form
activate Resource
Resource --> UI: Form DO dengan produk dari PO
deactivate Resource
UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan form
deactivate UI

Supplier -> UI: Input detail DO\n- Nomor DO\n- Tanggal pengiriman\n- Estimasi kedatangan\n- Upload dokumen DO\n- Input produk & jumlah
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Submit DO data
activate Resource

note right of Resource
    - Generate nomor shipment
    - Validasi jumlah produk
    - Set status = Draft
end note

Resource -> Shipment: Create shipment with details
activate Shipment
Shipment -> DB: Save shipment & details
activate DB
DB --> Shipment: Success
deactivate DB
Shipment --> Resource: Shipment instance
deactivate Shipment

Resource --> UI: Success response
deactivate Resource
UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan hasil
deactivate UI

== Edit DO ==
Supplier -> UI: Pilih Shipment\nKlik Edit
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request edit form
activate Resource
Resource -> Shipment: Find shipment by ID
activate Shipment
Shipment -> DB: Query shipment
activate DB
DB --> Shipment: Shipment data
deactivate DB

alt Status = Draft
    Shipment --> Resource: Shipment instance
    deactivate Shipment
    Resource --> UI: Edit form with data
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan form edit
    deactivate UI

    Supplier -> UI: Update data DO
    activate UI
    UI -> Resource: Submit updated data
    activate Resource

    note right of Resource
        - Update DO data
        - Update detail produk
        - Validasi dan simpan
    end note

    Resource -> Shipment: Update shipment
    activate Shipment
    Shipment -> DB: Save changes
    activate DB
    DB --> Shipment: Success
    deactivate DB
    Shipment --> Resource: Updated instance
    deactivate Shipment

    Resource --> UI: Success response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan hasil
    deactivate UI
else Status != Draft
    Shipment --> Resource: Not editable
    deactivate Shipment
    Resource --> UI: Error response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan error\n"DO tidak dapat diubah"
    deactivate UI
end

== Lihat DO ==
Supplier -> UI: Akses menu Shipment
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request shipment list
activate Resource
Resource -> DB: Query shipments by supplier
activate DB
DB --> Resource: Shipment data
deactivate DB
Resource --> UI: Shipment list
deactivate Resource
UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan daftar DO
deactivate UI

== Kirim Barang ==
Supplier -> UI: Pilih Shipment (Draft)\nKlik "Kirim Barang"
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request ship action
activate Resource
Resource -> Shipment: Update status to Shipped
activate Shipment

note right of Shipment
    Set status = Shipped
end note

Shipment -> DB: Update status
activate DB
DB --> Shipment: Success
deactivate DB
Shipment --> Resource: Updated instance
deactivate Shipment

Resource -> Notif: Send notification to\nAdmin Gudang & Checker
activate Notif
Notif --> Resource: Sent
deactivate Notif

Resource --> UI: Success response
deactivate Resource
UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan hasil\n"Barang dikirim"
deactivate UI

@enduml
